  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "2aa78a0b349f",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "anchor": "first-steps",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "First Steps"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0e4c6ccea9a8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The simplest FastAPI file could look like this:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4ec51e5d164d",
      "kind": "tabs",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Python 3.10+",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "f50d99758491",
              "kind": "code",
              "text": "from fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\n\n@app.get(\"/\")\nasync def root():\n    return {\"message\": \"Hello World\"}\n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f9c5b0f20892",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Copy that to a file "
        },
        {
          "text": "main.py",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2cf68536e6f9",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "tip",
      "title": "Tip",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "8cfe56695e0a",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "FastAPI has an "
            },
            {
              "text": "official extension for VS Code",
              "link": {
                "href": "https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=FastAPILabs.fastapi-vscode",
                "kind": "external"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": " (and Cursor), which provides a lot of features, including a path operation explorer, path operation search, CodeLens navigation in tests (jump to definition from tests), and FastAPI Cloud deployment and logs, all from your editor."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "198c6393060e",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Run the live server:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1ca810853b46",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "console",
      "text": "$ uv run fastapi dev\n\n   FastAPI   Starting development server 🚀\n\n             Searching for package file structure from directories\n             with __init__.py files\n             Importing from /home/user/code/awesomeapp\n\n    module   🐍 main.py\n\n      code   Importing the FastAPI app object from the module with\n             the following code:\n\n             <u style=\"text-decoration-style:solid\">from </u><u style=\"text-decoration-style:solid\"><b>main</b></u><u style=\"text-decoration-style:solid\"> import </u><u style=\"text-decoration-style:solid\"><b>app</b></u>\n\n       app   Using import string: main:app\n\n    server   Server started at <u style=\"text-decoration-style:solid\">http://127.0.0.1:8000</u>\n    server   Documentation at <u style=\"text-decoration-style:solid\">http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs</u>\n\n       tip   Running in development mode, for production use:\n             <b>fastapi run</b>\n\n             Logs:\n\n      INFO   Will watch for changes in these directories:\n             <b>[</b>&apos;/home/user/code/awesomeapp&apos;<b>]</b>\n      INFO   Uvicorn running on <u style=\"text-decoration-style:solid\">http://127.0.0.1:8000</u> <b>(</b>Press CTRL+C\n             to quit<b>)</b>\n      INFO   Started reloader process <b>[</b><b>383138</b><b>]</b> using WatchFiles\n      INFO   Started server process <b>[</b><b>383153</b><b>]</b>\n      INFO   Waiting for application startup.\n      INFO   Application startup complete.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d61d11adf39",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "In the output, there's a line with something like:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a10d0d814a98",
      "kind": "code",
      "text": "INFO:     Uvicorn running on http://127.0.0.1:8000 (Press CTRL+C to quit)\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "696019044ccf",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "That line shows the URL where your app is being served on your local machine."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06048d4c95da",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "anchor": "check-it",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Check it"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f657dbe3db7f",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Open your browser at "
        },
        {
          "text": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
          "link": {
            "href": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
            "kind": "external"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "227337208be9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You will see the JSON response as:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "16ce9bbfe5bd",
      "kind": "code",
      "text": "{\"message\": \"Hello World\"}\n"
    }
  ]
}
